-- 20260919_isle_invasion_other_zones_cleanup.sql
-- Cleans DoN Thundercrest/Stillmoon spawnentry that B7 injected into local
-- spawngroups across non-DoN zones (id collisions). For each collided id: local
-- content is moved to a fresh id (spawn2 repointed) and the original id is renamed
-- to the canonical upstream DoN group name. Leaked points with no local content are
-- disabled. See docs/isle-invasion-leak-2026-09.md.
-- Repop: the zones listed in the summary.
